 "id": "cases/evolve-default",
 "type": "fyo:ScenarioSpecification",
 "title": {
  "zh": "缺省（回到出厂设置）",
  "en": "Defaults (as shipped)"
 },
 "note": {
  "zh": "★这一档不是一个算例，是**回到页面的出厂设置**：换过几轮控件之后，它是唯一能把这条栏放回已知起点的一步。它不点任何装置，也不需要导入任何文件。",
  "en": "★Not a worked case but a RESET: after a few rounds of dragging controls this is the one step that puts the bar back on a known starting point. It names no machine and needs no file."
 },
 "prescribed_task_kind": "fyo:PhysicsModelingTask",
 "prescribes_code": {
  "id": "code/evolve",
  "type": "spo:Code",
  "name": "fylite",
  "comment": "capability `evolve` of the fylite tool register (python/fylite/scenario/__init__.py TOOLS['evolve']); the parameter IRIs `code/evolve#<name>` are this capability's control vocabulary"
 },
